{"video":"Il7cr2yGVKI","lines":[{"t":[0,2.8],"en":"- Spencer and I are getting married. - Ahh!"},{"t":[4.5,6.2],"en":"- Wow! - Isn't it grand?"},{"t":[6.3,7.5],"en":"So grand."},{"t":[8.8,10.3],"en":"Okay, that's it!"},{"t":[11.8,13],"en":"Ah, my arm!"},{"t":[15.5,17.2],"en":"Make some spaghetti tacos!"},{"t":[17.3,20.3],"en":"What? We're having steamed halibut for dinner."},{"t":[21.8,24],"en":"You hate steamed halibut 'cause it's boring."},{"t":[24.1,26.1],"en":"You like to make spaghetti tacos."},{"t":[26.2,28.3],"en":"And when you make 'em, you sing a little song."},{"t":[28.4,31.2],"en":"Carly, I only sing songs in church."},{"t":[33.7,34.9],"en":"What's wrong with your sister?"},{"t":[35,37.2],"en":"I'm not just his sister, I'm your friend!"},{"t":[37.3,38.8],"en":"Carly, I think you better calm down."},{"t":[38.9,41.2],"en":"- I don't wanna calm down! - She's crazy."},{"t":[41.3,42.3],"en":"I heard that, Rona!"},{"t":[44,45.7],"en":"Can I get you some ibuprofen?"},{"t":[45.8,46.8],"en":"No!"},{"t":[47.5,49.1],"en":"I just want you back."},{"t":[49.2,51.3],"en":"I want you the way you're supposed to be."},{"t":[51.6,55.5],"en":"I want you to make crazy sculptures and to accidentally set stuff on fire"},{"t":[55.6,57.7],"en":"and to wear socks that light up."},{"t":[57.8,61.1],"en":"And I want you to be single and lonely again!"},{"t":[61.9,64.2],"en":"And I want you to leave the country!"},{"t":[64.3,66.7],"en":"And nobody even likes you!"},{"t":[67.4,69.7],"en":"And I want Sam back!"},{"t":[69.8,72.7],"en":"And I want you to be my friend and stay in 5-4-3-2,"},{"t":[72.8,75.7],"en":"but not the one which I never understood, but I liked it!"},{"t":[75.8,78],"en":"And I just want my life back!"},{"t":[85.1,85.4],"en":"Where are you?"},{"t":[92.5,93.4],"en":"Where are you?"},{"t":[94.4,95.4],"en":"Mitch!"},{"t":[98.9,100.4],"en":"I want my life back!"},{"t":[102.4,104.3],"en":"I don't want Spencer to be normal!"},{"t":[104.4,106.3],"en":"I want him to be all abnormal again!"},{"t":[107.5,108.3],"en":"Please!"},{"t":[109.4,110.3],"en":"Mitch!"},{"t":[111.3,113.8],"en":"I want you to change everything back to the way it was!"},{"t":[114.3,116.9],"en":"Spencer, Sam, Freddy, everything!"},{"t":[118.6,119.4],"en":"Mitch!"},{"t":[132,132.9],"en":"Oh, there you are!"},{"t":[132.9,144.4],"en":"Hey, did you check out that video I sent of the guy who could fit a whole grapefruit?"},{"t":[146.1,146.6],"en":"Hey!"},{"t":[148.4,149.4],"en":"Hey, are you crying?"},{"t":[149.6,150.7],"en":"Just leave me alone!"},{"t":[151.4,156.6],"en":"Um, okay, but for the next iCarly, we gotta figure out which video's going up in the first segment."},{"t":[156.7,157.5],"en":"iCarly?"},{"t":[159,160.8],"en":"Did you just say for the next iCarly?"},{"t":[161.2,162.2],"en":"Yeah?"},{"t":[162.3,163],"en":"Why are you..."},{"t":[166.9,168],"en":"It's back!"},{"t":[168.1,169.8],"en":"Our studio's back!"},{"t":[170.7,171.9],"en":"Hello, old car!"},{"t":[172.4,173.6],"en":"Hello, beanbags!"},{"t":[173.9,175.9],"en":"Hello, hammer that almost killed me!"},{"t":[177.1,178.3],"en":"It's all back!"},{"t":[182.8,185.1],"en":"Whoa, Daddy, what is going on here?"},{"t":[186.9,187.6],"en":"Sam!"},{"t":[190.6,191.9],"en":"You're out of Juvie!"},{"t":[192,192.9],"en":"Juvie?"},{"t":[193,194],"en":"What are you talking about?"},{"t":[206.9,207.4],"en":"Hey, what's up, kid?"},{"t":[207.5,208],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[208.7,211.4],"en":"Hey, what's up with all the, uh, squeezing and squishing?"},{"t":[212.2,213.3],"en":"I missed you!"},{"t":[214.3,215.6],"en":"And our house is back!"},{"t":[217.2,218.9],"en":"Okay, I have no idea what you're..."},{"t":[219,222],"en":"Hey, Spencer, do you want us to help you take that tree down to the garbage?"},{"t":[222.1,223.6],"en":"Yeah, just help me stuff it in..."},{"t":[223.7,224.6],"en":"No!"},{"t":[224.6,227],"en":"No one touches this tree!"},{"t":[227.9,228.9],"en":"I thought you hated it!"},{"t":[229,230],"en":"I do not!"},{"t":[230.1,231.7],"en":"It's my favorite tree ever!"},{"t":[232.4,234.5],"en":"Come on, let's put it back over there where it belongs!"},{"t":[235,235.5],"en":"Okay!"},{"t":[237,237.5],"en":"Let's go!"},{"t":[237.6,238.5],"en":"All right, yeah!"},{"t":[238.6,239.3],"en":"Here we go!"},{"t":[239.4,239.9],"en":"Right in the middle!"},{"t":[240,240.5],"en":"All right!"},{"t":[240.6,241.1],"en":"Okay!"},{"t":[241.2,242.5],"en":"Go, go, go, go!"},{"t":[242.6,244],"en":"Slow, slow, slow!"},{"t":[244.1,245.4],"en":"All right!"},{"t":[245.5,246],"en":"All right, go right there!"},{"t":[246.1,247],"en":"And to the right, to the right!"},{"t":[247,247.5],"en":"Right over here!"},{"t":[247.6,248],"en":"Hey, a little bit!"},{"t":[248.1,249],"en":"Keep going, keep going, stop!"},{"t":[249.1,250.5],"en":"Okay, all right!"},{"t":[250.6,251.5],"en":"Just go right there!"},{"t":[251.6,253.5],"en":"See, that's not bad at all!"},{"t":[253.6,255.1],"en":"It just needs a little love!"},{"t":[255.2,256],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[260,262.4],"en":"You guys told me to slam some decorations on it real quick!"},{"t":[262.5,263],"en":"Sure!"},{"t":[263.7,264.4],"en":"Oh, I like this!"},{"t":[264.5,264.9],"en":"Oh, wow!"},{"t":[265,265.8],"en":"This one's..."},{"t":[265.9,266.4],"en":"Get in there!"},{"t":[266.5,267],"en":"All right!"},{"t":[267.1,267.8],"en":"Oh, banana!"},{"t":[267.9,268.6],"en":"I love bananas!"},{"t":[268.7,269.2],"en":"Nice!"},{"t":[269.3,270],"en":"What do you like?"},{"t":[270.1,272],"en":"Mmm, right there!"},{"t":[272.1,273.7],"en":"It complements the tree nicely!"},{"t":[274.1,274.6],"en":"Nice!"},{"t":[275.1,275.6],"en":"Get in there!"},{"t":[275.7,276.2],"en":"I like it right here!"},{"t":[276.3,276.9],"en":"Sort of near the top!"},{"t":[277,277.7],"en":"Right there!"},{"t":[277.8,278.4],"en":"Oh, that's nice!"},{"t":[278.5,278.8],"en":"All right!"},{"t":[278.9,279.6],"en":"That looks a little better!"},{"t":[279.7,280.6],"en":"Here, help me, uh, put the garlic on it!"},{"t":[280.7,281.2],"en":"Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah!"},{"t":[281.3,282.2],"en":"All right, um, start it..."},{"t":[282.3,282.7],"en":"Where's the egg?"},{"t":[282.8,283.6],"en":"Cookies are so good!"},{"t":[283.7,284.5],"en":"Okay, right..."},{"t":[284.6,285.7],"en":"That was perfect!"},{"t":[285.8,286.5],"en":"All right!"},{"t":[286.6,287.8],"en":"Here, let's put this all in on it!"},{"t":[287.9,288.5],"en":"Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!"},{"t":[288.6,289.9],"en":"Okay, look, start..."},{"t":[290,291.4],"en":"Wait, wait, I think I like eggnog!"},{"t":[291.5,292.2],"en":"A little nutmeg!"},{"t":[292.3,293.2],"en":"Surrounding the..."},{"t":[293.3,294.6],"en":"It'll be nice and better for you!"},{"t":[296.1,297],"en":"Thanks, Mitch!"},{"t":[297.1,298],"en":"Thank you!"},{"t":[298.1,299.2],"en":"Why, thank me!"},{"t":[299.3,300.7],"en":"'Cause if it wasn't for you..."},{"t":[302,303.8],"en":"I would have never gotten my wings!"},{"t":[307.7,309],"en":"Chicken wings?"},{"t":[311.2,312.5],"en":"Merry Christmas, Carly!"},{"t":[313.2,314.5],"en":"Merry Christmas, Mitch!"},{"t":[317.2,318],"en":"We gotta make it look good!"},{"t":[318.1,318.6],"en":"Okay!"},{"t":[322.9,323.6],"en":"Wow!"},{"t":[324.9,325.7],"en":"Looks nice, huh?"},{"t":[326.2,326.8],"en":"Yep!"},{"t":[331.2,334.8],"en":"Spencer, you're not normal, but you did build a nice tree."},{"t":[361.2,364.2],"en":"Time, man! It's slippery!"}]}
